  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: an operator edits one node's config file
  s0 --> s2: you send a message
  s1 --> s4: the hub copies its setting to the database
  s2 --> s3: an operator edits one node's config file
  s3 --> s5: the gateway starts the turn itself
  s4 --> s6: you send a message
  s5 --> s7: you send a message
  s6 --> s8: the gateway puts the input into shared custody
  s7 --> s9: the answer reaches Discord
  s8 --> s10: the input is handed to the node that owns the channel
  s9 --> s11: the hub copies its setting to the database
  s10 --> s12: the input leaves custody with no turn
  s11 --> s13: the gateway puts the input into shared custody
  s13 --> s14: the old home is asked to end its session
  s14 --> s15: the request's deadline passes without an answer
  s15 --> s16: the owner row moves to the new home
  s16 --> s10: the old home ends its idle session
  s12 --> s17: you send a message
  s17 --> s17: a node reads the owner row again
  s17 --> s18: the gateway puts the input into shared custody
  s18 --> s19: the input is handed to the node that owns the channel
  s19 --> s20: the input leaves custody with no turn
  s20 --> s21: you send a message
  s21 --> s22: the gateway puts the input into shared custody
  s22 --> s23: the input is handed to the node that owns the channel
  s23 --> s24: the input leaves custody with no turn
